        "thought_text": "Use dynamic programming where dp[i] is the number of ways to reach step i, initializing dp[0]=1 and dp[a_j]=0 for broken steps, then iterating from 1 to N with transitions dp[i] = (dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]) % MOD.",
